00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Wind tunnels, coastdown tests and simulation answer different questions and carry different uncertainties. Match method to the claim.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
A coastdown result includes more than aerodynamic drag unless rolling and drivetrain effects are separated.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Method selection

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
